  "narrative": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">How to edit a manuscript on GitHub with Manubot (2019) in Figshare. SDG alignment: Quality Education.</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">How to edit a manuscript on GitHub with Manubot (2019) in Figshare is authored by the authors. Topics: Computer science, Software, World Wide Web, Open source and Open source software.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">No citations yet.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Limited online visibility beyond citations.</p>",
